      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Below you can find some good examples for how all the visualizations in Grafana can be configured. You can also explore [play.grafana.org](https://play.grafana.org) which has a large set of demo dashboards that showcase all the different visualizations.",
