      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For time based line, area and bar charts we recommend the default [time series](ref:time-series) visualization. [This public demo dashboard](https://play.grafana.org/d/000000016/1-time-series-graphs?orgId=1) contains many different examples for how this visualization can be configured and styled.",
