      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Alert lists allow you to display a list of important alerts that you want to track. You can configure the alert list to show the current state of your alert, such as firing, pending, or normal. Learn more about alerts in [Grafana Alerting overview](ref:grafana-alerting-overview).",
