      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A bar chart is a visual representation that uses rectangular bars, where the length of each bar represents each value. You can use the bar chart visualization when you want to compare values over different categories or time periods. The visualization can display the bars horizontally or vertically, and can be customized to group or stack bars for more complex data analysis.",
