      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Show grid lines | Set whether grid lines are displayed in the chart. Choose from: <ul><li>**Auto** - Grafana automatically determines whether grid lines are displayed.</li><li>**On** - Grid lines are always displayed.</li><li>**Off** - Grid lines are never displayed</li></ul> |",
