      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To create a bar gauge visualization, you need a dataset querying at least one numeric field. Every numeric field in the dataset is displayed as a bar gauge. Text or time fields aren't required but if they're present, they're used for labeling.",
