    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ff382a2f5cec84afe737",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Orientation | Choose a stacking direction:<ul><li>**Auto** - Grafana determines the best orientation.</li><li>**Horizontal** - Bars stretch horizontally, left to right.</li><li>**Vertical** - Bars stretch vertically, bottom to top.</li></ul> |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Bar gauge",
        "Configuration options",
        "Bar gauge options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/bar-gauge/index.md",
