    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.318e41c6c0a5e77cd8be",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Name placement | Set the name placement mode when the bar gauge orientation is **Auto** or **Horizontal**. Choose from:<ul><li>**Auto** - Grafana determines the best placement.</li><li>**Top** - Names are placed on top of each bar gauge.</li><li>**Left** - Names are placed to the left of each bar gauge.</li><li>**Hidden** - Names are hidden.</li></ul> <p>When the bar gauge is in the vertical orientation, choose from **Auto** (names are always placed at the bottom of each bar) or **Hidden**.</p>|",
      "headingPath": [
        "Bar gauge",
        "Configuration options",
        "Bar gauge options"
      ],
