      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Bar size | Choose a bar size mode:<ul><li>**Auto** - Grafana determines the best bar size.</li><li>**Manual** - Manually configure the bar size.</li></ul> |",
      "headingPath": [
