      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Min width | Limit the minimum width of the bar column when the gauge is oriented vertically or is in **Auto** mode. Automatically shows the x-axis scroll bar when there's a large amount of data.<p>This option only applies when the **Bar size** mode is set to **Manual**.</p> |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Bar gauge",
        "Configuration options",
        "Bar gauge options"
