    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f22fe6788435a4cda0fb",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Candle style                                           | Controls the appearance of the candles. Choose from:<ul><li>**Candles** - The default display style, which creates candle-style markers between the open and close dimensions.</li><li>**OHLC Bars** - Displays values for the four core dimensions, open, high, low, and close.</li></ul> This option is hidden when **Mode** is **Volume**. |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Candlestick",
        "Configuration options",
        "Candlestick options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/candlestick/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ea3b660d4134adcfd2fa5b60a61b1ce9ca72ac03",
