    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.23ce521f19e0b96a0437",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| [Color strategy](#color-strategy)                      | Controls how colors are applied to dimensions. Choose from:<ul><li>**Since Open** - This mode uses the **Up color** if the intra-period price movement is positive.</li><li>**Since Prior Close** - The color of the candle is based on the inter-period price movement or change in value.</li></ul>                                         |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Candlestick",
        "Configuration options",
        "Candlestick options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/candlestick/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ea3b660d4134adcfd2fa5b60a61b1ce9ca72ac03",
