      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| [Additional fields](#additional-fields)                | The **Include** and **Ignore** options allow the candlestick visualization to display other included data such as simple moving averages, Bollinger bands and more, using the same styles and configurations available in the [time series](ref:time-series-visualization) visualization.                                                     |",
