      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Since Open** - The default behavior. This mode uses the **Up color** if the intra-period price movement is positive. In other words, if the value on close is greater or equal to the value on open, the **Up color** is used.",
      "headingPath": [
