      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If your data can't be mapped to these dimensions for some reason (for example, because the column names aren't the same), you can map them manually using the **Open**, **High**, **Low**, and **Close** fields under the **Candlestick** options in the panel editor:",
