    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b6f3ce912085a7de6596",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Canvases combine the power of Grafana with the flexibility of custom elements. They are extensible visualizations that allow you to add and arrange elements wherever you want within unstructured static and dynamic layouts. This lets you design custom visualizations and overlay data in ways that aren't possible with standard Grafana visualizations, all within the Grafana UI.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Canvas"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c20618518d4c52ffd64005377df7f86c63040233",
        "sha256": "5017fedbee72282f54bf8c7a972608f2e6b9ac65eca16e73edf2640e0dd582ea",
        "lineStart": 29,
        "lineEnd": 31,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md#L29-L31"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cd1c7605ca860dff620a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you've used popular UI and web design tools, then designing canvases will feel very familiar. With all of these dynamic elements, there's almost no limit to what a canvas can display.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Canvas"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c20618518d4c52ffd64005377df7f86c63040233",
        "sha256": "5017fedbee72282f54bf8c7a972608f2e6b9ac65eca16e73edf2640e0dd582ea",
        "lineStart": 35,
        "lineEnd": 36,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md#L35-L36"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b0be90e970415c8adb60",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The following video shows you how to create and configure a canvas visualization:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Canvas",
        "Configure a canvas visualization"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c20618518d4c52ffd64005377df7f86c63040233",
        "sha256": "5017fedbee72282f54bf8c7a972608f2e6b9ac65eca16e73edf2640e0dd582ea",
        "lineStart": 44,
        "lineEnd": 44,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md#L44-L44"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3d47001deffff1bd17e6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The canvas visualization is unique in that it doesn't have any specific data requirements. You can even start adding and configuring visual elements without providing any data. However, any data you plan to consume should be accessible through supported Grafana data sources and structured in a way that ensures smooth integration with your custom elements.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Canvas",
        "Supported data formats"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c20618518d4c52ffd64005377df7f86c63040233",
        "sha256": "5017fedbee72282f54bf8c7a972608f2e6b9ac65eca16e73edf2640e0dd582ea",
        "lineStart": 50,
        "lineEnd": 50,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md#L50-L50"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.599113f0f44f28455771",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If your canvas is going to update in real time, your data should support refreshes at your desired intervals without degrading the user experience.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Canvas",
        "Supported data formats"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c20618518d4c52ffd64005377df7f86c63040233",
        "sha256": "5017fedbee72282f54bf8c7a972608f2e6b9ac65eca16e73edf2640e0dd582ea",
        "lineStart": 52,
        "lineEnd": 52,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md#L52-L52"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bc40beabf5d102b92ae2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can tie [Elements](#elements) and [Connections](#connections) to data through options like text, colors, and background pattern images, etc. available in the canvas visualization.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Canvas",
        "Supported data formats"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c20618518d4c52ffd64005377df7f86c63040233",
        "sha256": "5017fedbee72282f54bf8c7a972608f2e6b9ac65eca16e73edf2640e0dd582ea",
        "lineStart": 54,
        "lineEnd": 54,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md#L54-L54"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7b120701c6fb1adf62b6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Elements are the basic building blocks of a canvas and they help you visualize data with different shapes and options. You can rotate and move elements around the canvas. When you move elements, snapping and alignment guides help you create more precise layouts.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Canvas",
        "Elements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c20618518d4c52ffd64005377df7f86c63040233",
        "sha256": "5017fedbee72282f54bf8c7a972608f2e6b9ac65eca16e73edf2640e0dd582ea",
        "lineStart": 58,
        "lineEnd": 58,
