    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.038abc680da75653870a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A basic shape element can display text (both fixed and field data) and its background color can be changed based on data thresholds. You can add the following basic shapes to a canvas:",
