    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d1ff10decbe7aafaef27",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The server element lets you easily represent a single server, a stack of servers, a database, or a terminal. Server elements support status color, bulb color, and a bulb blink rate all configurable by fixed or field values.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Canvas",
        "Elements",
        "Element types",
        "Server"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md",
