    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c5ced99157c4f03c412f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can set the size, color, direction, and style of connections based on fixed or field values. To do so, enter into panel edit mode, select the connection, and modify the connection's properties in the panel editor. For more information on connection styles, refer to [Selected connection options](#selected-connection-options).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Canvas",
        "Connections",
        "Connection styles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c20618518d4c52ffd64005377df7f86c63040233",
        "sha256": "5017fedbee72282f54bf8c7a972608f2e6b9ac65eca16e73edf2640e0dd582ea",
        "lineStart": 206,
        "lineEnd": 206,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md#L206-L206"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dd5f3a84469b019aa7c8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can make changes to a canvas visualization while in the context of the dashboard, or in dashboard mode. The following sections describe the editing options available in dashboard mode.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Canvas",
        "Canvas editing"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c20618518d4c52ffd64005377df7f86c63040233",
        "sha256": "5017fedbee72282f54bf8c7a972608f2e6b9ac65eca16e73edf2640e0dd582ea",
        "lineStart": 212,
        "lineEnd": 212,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md#L212-L212"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1bd8e6d97aa231f13d29",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can edit your canvas inline while in dashboard mode. The inline editor menu displays the options relevant to the part of the canvas that you've selected. You can also move the editor window around.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Canvas",
        "Canvas editing",
        "Inline editor"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c20618518d4c52ffd64005377df7f86c63040233",
        "sha256": "5017fedbee72282f54bf8c7a972608f2e6b9ac65eca16e73edf2640e0dd582ea",
        "lineStart": 216,
        "lineEnd": 216,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md#L216-L216"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ec4e08a1f040edc39166",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The context menu lets you perform common tasks quickly and efficiently. Supported functionality includes opening and closing the inline editor, duplicating an element, deleting an element, and more.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Canvas",
        "Canvas editing",
        "Context menu"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c20618518d4c52ffd64005377df7f86c63040233",
        "sha256": "5017fedbee72282f54bf8c7a972608f2e6b9ac65eca16e73edf2640e0dd582ea",
        "lineStart": 222,
        "lineEnd": 222,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md#L222-L222"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5d94e0ef0ca8a29ced5a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The context menu is triggered by a right click action over the panel or over a given canvas element. When right clicking the panel, you are able to set a background image and easily add elements to the canvas.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Canvas",
        "Canvas editing",
        "Context menu"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c20618518d4c52ffd64005377df7f86c63040233",
        "sha256": "5017fedbee72282f54bf8c7a972608f2e6b9ac65eca16e73edf2640e0dd582ea",
        "lineStart": 224,
        "lineEnd": 224,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md#L224-L224"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.46ec0502b4909de8f859",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When right clicking an element, you are able to edit, delete, duplicate, and modify the element's layer positioning.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Canvas",
        "Canvas editing",
        "Context menu"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/canvas/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c20618518d4c52ffd64005377df7f86c63040233",
