      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The **Disable for one-click elements** setting allows hiding tooltips on elements that have one-click functionality enabled. This prevents tooltips from interfering with one-click interactions while still allowing tooltips on other elements.",
