    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.937482eafc0dcb8e0237",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Flame graphs let you visualize [profiling](https://grafana.com/docs/pyroscope/latest/introduction/what-is-profiling/) data. Using this visualization, a [profile](https://grafana.com/docs/pyroscope/latest/view-and-analyze-profile-data/profiling-types/) can be represented as a [flame graph](#flame-graph-mode), [top table](#top-table-mode), or both.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Flame graph"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/flame-graph/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "516216a41ec14dd068113d17d449c7e5418063df",
        "sha256": "156d31d59646a5ae88a2b1b202ef874ef58269b49f2ceee6cc7f0456887db115",
        "lineStart": 34,
        "lineEnd": 34,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/flame-graph/index.md#L34-L34"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d053e17cd34df2f4ff42",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, if you want to understand which parts of a program consume the most resources, such as CPU time, memory, or I/O operations, you can use a flame graph to visualize and analyze where potential performance issues are:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Flame graph"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/flame-graph/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "516216a41ec14dd068113d17d449c7e5418063df",
