    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4b9074e3ea7c171aa798",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Once you’ve created a [dashboard](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-dashboard/), the following video shows you how to configure a flame graph visualization:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Flame graph",
        "Configure a flame graph visualization"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/flame-graph/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "516216a41ec14dd068113d17d449c7e5418063df",
        "sha256": "156d31d59646a5ae88a2b1b202ef874ef58269b49f2ceee6cc7f0456887db115",
        "lineStart": 50,
        "lineEnd": 50,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/flame-graph/index.md#L50-L50"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3744c40d3fe2ec17e04a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To render a flame graph, you must format the data frame data using a _nested set model_.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Flame graph",
        "Supported data formats"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/flame-graph/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "516216a41ec14dd068113d17d449c7e5418063df",
        "sha256": "156d31d59646a5ae88a2b1b202ef874ef58269b49f2ceee6cc7f0456887db115",
        "lineStart": 58,
        "lineEnd": 58,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/flame-graph/index.md#L58-L58"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ebaf42974bf8529b501e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A nested set model ensures each item of a flame graph is encoded by its nesting level as an integer value, its metadata, and by its order in the data frame. This means that the order of items is significant and needs to be correct. The ordering is a depth-first traversal of the items in the flame graph which recreates the graph without needing variable-length values in the data frame like in a children's array.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Flame graph",
        "Supported data formats"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/flame-graph/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "516216a41ec14dd068113d17d449c7e5418063df",
        "sha256": "156d31d59646a5ae88a2b1b202ef874ef58269b49f2ceee6cc7f0456887db115",
        "lineStart": 60,
        "lineEnd": 60,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/flame-graph/index.md#L60-L60"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
