    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e1675b8551e407adaf57",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Standard options** in the panel editor pane let you change how field data is displayed in your visualizations. When you set a standard option, the change is applied to all fields or series. For more granular control over the display of fields, refer to [Configure field overrides](ref:configure-field-overrides).",
