      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Calculation | If you chose **Calculate** as your **Show** option, select a reducer function that Grafana will use to reduce many fields to a single value. For a list of available calculations, refer to [Calculation types](ref:calculation-types). |",
      "headingPath": [
