      "sourceText": "| Orientation | Choose a stacking direction:<ul><li>**Auto** - Gauges display in rows and columns.</li><li>**Horizontal** - Gauges display top to bottom.</li><li>**Vertical** - Gauges display left to right.</li></ul> |",
