      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Min width | Set the minimum width of vertically oriented gauges. If you set a minimum width, the x-axis scroll bar is automatically displayed when there's a large amount of data. This option only applies when **Gauge orientation** is **Vertical** and **Gauge size** is set to **Manual**. |",
