      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Text mode | Choose what text to render in the gauge:<ul><li>**Auto** - Grafana determines the text to show.</li><li>**Value and name** - Renders both the value and series name.</li><li>**Value** - Renders only the value.</li><li>**Name** - Renders only the series name.</li><li>**None** - Renders the gauge with no labels.</li></ul> |",
