    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d77912612efcabd6fa23",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, you want to display the storage of several batteries and the power range is from -2.5 kW (discharging) to 2.5 kW. When the minimum value is used as the starting point for the gauges, the visualization looks like this:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Gauge",
        "Configuration options",
        "Gauge options",
        "Neutral value"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/gauge/index.md",
