    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.343d49add72d5bc3ea2b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you want to visualize the list of values as a time series along with the calculated gauge value, toggle on the **Show sparkline** switch. Each gauge displays the sparkline inside the circle or arc:",
