    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.900543865dfe662e78df",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Geomaps allow you to view and customize the world map using geospatial data. It's the ideal visualization if you have data that includes location information and you want to see it displayed in a map.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Geomap"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63538536072461656f914e26183413137e6e6b8c",
        "sha256": "08446649298bae8331b3153d028da647940a189b37434f0fbef1ff26fabe47eb",
        "lineStart": 53,
        "lineEnd": 53,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md#L53-L53"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.61a79961430737af3f81",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can configure and overlay [map layers](#layer-type), like heatmaps and networks, and blend included basemaps or your own custom maps. This helps you to easily focus on the important location-based characteristics of the data.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Geomap"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63538536072461656f914e26183413137e6e6b8c",
        "sha256": "08446649298bae8331b3153d028da647940a189b37434f0fbef1ff26fabe47eb",
        "lineStart": 55,
        "lineEnd": 55,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md#L55-L55"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.925755296e0e4735c84b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When a geomap is in focus, in addition to typical mouse controls, you can pan around using the arrow keys or zoom in and out using the plus (`+`) and minus (`-`) keys or icons.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Geomap"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63538536072461656f914e26183413137e6e6b8c",
        "sha256": "08446649298bae8331b3153d028da647940a189b37434f0fbef1ff26fabe47eb",
        "lineStart": 59,
        "lineEnd": 59,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md#L59-L59"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5181ac1e5e458c599fac",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Geomaps are also useful when you have location data that’s changing in real time and you want to visualize where an element is moving, using auto-refresh.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Geomap"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md",
