    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8b448f5c5f1465c60941",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Size | Configures the size of the markers. The default is `Fixed size`, which makes all marker sizes the same regardless of the data; however, there is also an option to size the markers based on data corresponding to a selected field. `Min` and `Max` marker sizes have to be set such that the markers can scale within this range. |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Geomap",
        "Configuration options",
        "Map layers options",
        "Markers layer"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md",
