      "id": "grafana.candidate.715fcdc504b1d7f2a530",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Default style | Controls which styles to apply when no rules above match.<ul><li>**Color** - configures the color of the default style</li><li>**Opacity** - configures the default opacity</li></ul> |",
