    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9c2d4e154e60a8d75549",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The default basemap layer uses the CARTO map. You can define custom default base layers in the `.ini` configuration file.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Geomap",
        "Configuration options",
        "Basemap layer options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63538536072461656f914e26183413137e6e6b8c",
        "sha256": "08446649298bae8331b3153d028da647940a189b37434f0fbef1ff26fabe47eb",
        "lineStart": 560,
        "lineEnd": 560,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md#L560-L560"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.df38a72ee9256ec85dd1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can configure the default base map using config files with Grafana’s provisioning system. For more information on all the settings, refer to the [provisioning docs page](ref:provisioning-docs-page).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Geomap",
        "Configuration options",
        "Basemap layer options",
        "Configure the default base layer with provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63538536072461656f914e26183413137e6e6b8c",
        "sha256": "08446649298bae8331b3153d028da647940a189b37434f0fbef1ff26fabe47eb",
        "lineStart": 566,
        "lineEnd": 566,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md#L566-L566"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.674a44d744f4fe112cc9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Use the JSON configuration option `default_baselayer_config` to define the default base map. There are currently five base map options to choose from: `carto`, `esri-xyz`, `osm-standard`, `xyz`, `maplibre`. Here are some provisioning examples for each base map option.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Geomap",
        "Configuration options",
        "Basemap layer options",
        "Configure the default base layer with provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63538536072461656f914e26183413137e6e6b8c",
        "sha256": "08446649298bae8331b3153d028da647940a189b37434f0fbef1ff26fabe47eb",
        "lineStart": 568,
        "lineEnd": 568,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md#L568-L568"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a7a3a42853f39e1582f3",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **carto** loads the CartoDB tile server. You can choose from `auto`, `dark`, and `light` theme for the base map and can be set as shown below. The `showLabels` tag determines whether or not Grafana shows the Country details on top of the map. Here is an example:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Geomap",
        "Configuration options",
        "Basemap layer options",
        "Configure the default base layer with provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63538536072461656f914e26183413137e6e6b8c",
        "sha256": "08446649298bae8331b3153d028da647940a189b37434f0fbef1ff26fabe47eb",
        "lineStart": 570,
        "lineEnd": 570,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md#L570-L570"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.df31a32b8f9ae2ef00f4",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **esri-xyz** loads the ESRI tile server. There are already multiple server instances implemented to show the various map styles: `world-imagery`, `world-physical`, `topo`, `usa-topo`, and `ocean`. The `custom` server option allows you to configure your own ArcGIS map server. Here are some examples:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Geomap",
        "Configuration options",
        "Basemap layer options",
        "Configure the default base layer with provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63538536072461656f914e26183413137e6e6b8c",
        "sha256": "08446649298bae8331b3153d028da647940a189b37434f0fbef1ff26fabe47eb",
        "lineStart": 583,
        "lineEnd": 583,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md#L583-L583"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.99c6e0bb87df4855eb4b",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **osm-standard** loads the OpenStreetMap tile server. There are no additional configurations needed and the `config` fields can be left blank. Here is an example:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Geomap",
        "Configuration options",
        "Basemap layer options",
        "Configure the default base layer with provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63538536072461656f914e26183413137e6e6b8c",
        "sha256": "08446649298bae8331b3153d028da647940a189b37434f0fbef1ff26fabe47eb",
        "lineStart": 616,
        "lineEnd": 616,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md#L616-L616"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f4ee8e66b96c291f2b49",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **xyz** loads a custom tile server defined by the user. Set a valid tile server `url`, with {z}/{x}/{y} for this option in order to properly load a default base map. Here is an example:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Geomap",
        "Configuration options",
        "Basemap layer options",
        "Configure the default base layer with provisioning"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63538536072461656f914e26183413137e6e6b8c",
