    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.220a367775be234d6e4a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When a data point on the geomap represents one row&mdash;that is, only a single row of response data is relevant to that point&mdash;the tooltip displays a grid with the row's names and values:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Geomap",
        "Configuration options",
        "Map controls options",
        "Tooltip"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63538536072461656f914e26183413137e6e6b8c",
        "sha256": "08446649298bae8331b3153d028da647940a189b37434f0fbef1ff26fabe47eb",
        "lineStart": 741,
        "lineEnd": 741,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md#L741-L741"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.487d6c5e7aab99733642",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When a data point represents more than one row&mdash;that is, different rows but with the same geographical information&mdash;then each row appears as a single entry:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Geomap",
        "Configuration options",
        "Map controls options",
        "Tooltip"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63538536072461656f914e26183413137e6e6b8c",
        "sha256": "08446649298bae8331b3153d028da647940a189b37434f0fbef1ff26fabe47eb",
        "lineStart": 745,
        "lineEnd": 745,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md#L745-L745"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5829c35eeccbbc1c2d7e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The text displayed in each tooltip row is associated with the first field value in each data row. Click it to expand and display the full details of the data row.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Geomap",
        "Configuration options",
        "Map controls options",
        "Tooltip"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63538536072461656f914e26183413137e6e6b8c",
        "sha256": "08446649298bae8331b3153d028da647940a189b37434f0fbef1ff26fabe47eb",
        "lineStart": 749,
        "lineEnd": 750,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md#L749-L750"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.209249be7ce9d0991cb9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The data appearing in each detail row is determined by the underlying query and transformations applied to the query's results, and can't be directly controlled using tooltip options.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Geomap",
        "Configuration options",
        "Map controls options",
        "Tooltip"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "63538536072461656f914e26183413137e6e6b8c",
