    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ec5d3a17f2659cd5d9db",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Y Bucket scale | When **Calculate from data** is **Yes**. Select one of the following y-axis value scales:<ul><li>**Linear** - Linear scale.</li><li>**Logarithmic** - Choose a **Log base** of **2** or **10**.</li><li>**Symlog** - Symlog scale. Choose a **Log base** of **2** or **10** and enter a value for the **Linear threshold**.</li></ul> |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Heatmap",
        "Configuration options",
        "Heatmap options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/heatmap/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "26f146fc90a96db28152234a4f2b29fa80d22cd2",
        "sha256": "3707c3b75cabf6775b51701a3da3b83509e28b6df092b42f6aad0c341cc47b1a",
        "lineStart": 105,
        "lineEnd": 105,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/heatmap/index.md#L105-L105"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.df2c9812b4149aefdaca",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Y Bucket scale | When **Calculate from data** is **No**. Set the y-axis scale for pre-bucketed data in the wide, one-field-per-bucket data structure (not available when the response uses the heatmap-cells data frame type). Choose from:<ul><li>**Auto** - Uses the default scale behavior.</li><li>**Linear** - Linear scale.</li><li>**Log** - Logarithmic scale. Choose a **Log base** of **2** or **10**.</li><li>**Symlog** - Symmetrical logarithmic scale. Choose a **Log base** of **2** or **10** and enter a value for the **Linear threshold**.</li></ul> |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Heatmap",
        "Configuration options",
        "Heatmap options"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/heatmap/index.md",
