      "id": "grafana.candidate.3d2e55631041a2930839",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Exponential** - Power scale. Cell opacity calculated as `value ^ k`, where `k` is a configured **Exponent** value. If exponent is less than `1`, you will get a logarithmic scale. If exponent is greater than `1`, you will get an exponential scale. In case of `1`, scale will be the same as linear.",
      "headingPath": [
