    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.50830440dd035023c7d8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, Grafana calculates cell colors based on minimum and maximum bucket values. With **Start color scale from value** and **End color scale at value**, you can overwrite those values. Consider a bucket value as a z-axis, with the start and end values as z-min and z-max.",
