    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5d53700c2515879f21d7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, 5-sized buckets that are 0-5, 5-10, 10-15 with a default 0 offset would become 2-7, 7-12, 12-17 with an offset of 2; offsets of 0, 5, or 10, in this case, would effectively do nothing.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Histogram",
        "Configuration options",
        "Histogram options",
        "Bucket offset"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/histogram/index.md",
