    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cccd62b9ff6c0c896d09",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After you’ve created a [dashboard](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-dashboard/), enter the URL of an RSS in the **URL** field in the **News** section. This visualization type doesn't accept any other queries, and you shouldn't expect to be able to filter or query the RSS feed data in any way using this visualization.",
