      "sourceText": "If you're having trouble loading an RSS feed, you can try rehosting the feed on a different server or using a CORS proxy. A CORS proxy is a tool that allows you to bypass CORS restrictions by making requests to the RSS feed on your behalf. You can find more information about using CORS proxies online.",
      "headingPath": [
        "News",
        "Configure a news visualization"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/news/index.md",
