    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2105efe6917932ee2f44",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The following video provides beginner steps for creating node panel visualizations. You'll learn the data requirements and caveats, special customizations, and much more:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Node graph",
        "Configure a node graph visualization"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "7c586f93fdc1eaff30c91e430394f51a121e7775",
        "sha256": "f0da5170934666563792a7b39628b17cd29c47bc87bd6f21ff69e7d6bdebf1a4",
        "lineStart": 45,
        "lineEnd": 45,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md#L45-L45"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.33da4fb3570742db888f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To create node graphs, you need two datasets: one containing the records for the displayed elements (nodes) and one dataset containing the records for the connections between those elements (edges).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Node graph",
        "Supported data formats"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "7c586f93fdc1eaff30c91e430394f51a121e7775",
        "sha256": "f0da5170934666563792a7b39628b17cd29c47bc87bd6f21ff69e7d6bdebf1a4",
        "lineStart": 53,
        "lineEnd": 53,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md#L53-L53"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.315b1271ad47af49ad22",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The nodes dataset must contain one alphanumeric ID field that gives each element a unique identifier. The visualization also accepts other options fields for titles, subtitles, main and secondary stats, arc information for how much of the circle border to paint, details, colors, icons, node size, and indicators for element highlighting. For more information and naming conventions for these fields, refer to the [Nodes data frame structure](#nodes-data-frame-structure) section.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Node graph",
        "Supported data formats",
        "Nodes dataset"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "7c586f93fdc1eaff30c91e430394f51a121e7775",
        "sha256": "f0da5170934666563792a7b39628b17cd29c47bc87bd6f21ff69e7d6bdebf1a4",
        "lineStart": 57,
        "lineEnd": 57,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md#L57-L57"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.005219c9c957cae32b5c",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| id    | title | subtitle | mainstat | secondarystat | color | icon | highlighted |",
      "headingPath": [
