      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the icon field contains a value, it’s displayed instead of the title and subtitle. For a list of of available icons, refer to [Icons Overview](https://developers.grafana.com/ui/latest/index.html?path=/story/iconography-icon--icons-overview).",
