    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dc839b8b290d8f0b8ec7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If a node lacks edge connections, it’s displayed on its own outside of the network.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Node graph",
        "Supported data formats",
        "Edges dataset",
        "Example"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "7c586f93fdc1eaff30c91e430394f51a121e7775",
        "sha256": "f0da5170934666563792a7b39628b17cd29c47bc87bd6f21ff69e7d6bdebf1a4",
        "lineStart": 81,
        "lineEnd": 81,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md#L81-L81"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.77f5cdcc5038113c727f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A node graph requires a specific shape of the data to be able to display its nodes and edges. This means not every data source or query can be visualized with this graph. If you want to use this as a data source developer see the section about data API.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Node graph",
        "Supported data formats",
        "Data requirements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "7c586f93fdc1eaff30c91e430394f51a121e7775",
        "sha256": "f0da5170934666563792a7b39628b17cd29c47bc87bd6f21ff69e7d6bdebf1a4",
        "lineStart": 85,
        "lineEnd": 85,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md#L85-L85"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2778699394fc5052b88f",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- A _node_ is displayed as a circle. A node might represent an application, a service, or anything else that is relevant from an application perspective.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Node graph",
        "Supported data formats",
        "Data requirements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "7c586f93fdc1eaff30c91e430394f51a121e7775",
        "sha256": "f0da5170934666563792a7b39628b17cd29c47bc87bd6f21ff69e7d6bdebf1a4",
        "lineStart": 89,
        "lineEnd": 89,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md#L89-L89"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.897a04dc617c156a5c46",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- An _edge_ is displayed as a line that connects two nodes. The connection might be a request, an execution, or some other relationship between the two nodes.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Node graph",
        "Supported data formats",
        "Data requirements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "7c586f93fdc1eaff30c91e430394f51a121e7775",
        "sha256": "f0da5170934666563792a7b39628b17cd29c47bc87bd6f21ff69e7d6bdebf1a4",
        "lineStart": 90,
        "lineEnd": 90,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md#L90-L90"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4f58e1c031a92be93422",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Both nodes and edges can have associated metadata or statistics. The data source defines what information and values is shown, so different data sources can show different type of values or not show some values.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Node graph",
        "Supported data formats",
        "Data requirements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "7c586f93fdc1eaff30c91e430394f51a121e7775",
        "sha256": "f0da5170934666563792a7b39628b17cd29c47bc87bd6f21ff69e7d6bdebf1a4",
        "lineStart": 92,
        "lineEnd": 92,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md#L92-L92"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f63bfd8c9e6a43a5de7c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Node graphs show up to 200 visible nodes by default. If the graph has more nodes, Grafana shows a warning at the top of the panel and hides some nodes for performance reasons. You can expand hidden parts of the graph by clicking the \"Hidden nodes\" markers in the graph.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Node graph",
        "Supported data formats",
        "Data requirements",
        "Nodes"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "7c586f93fdc1eaff30c91e430394f51a121e7775",
        "sha256": "f0da5170934666563792a7b39628b17cd29c47bc87bd6f21ff69e7d6bdebf1a4",
        "lineStart": 97,
        "lineEnd": 97,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md#L97-L97"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.883024dbb1d530b49179",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Usually, nodes show two statistical values inside the node and two identifiers just below the node, usually name and type. Nodes can also show another set of values as a color circle around the node, with sections of different color represents different values that should add up to 1.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Node graph",
        "Supported data formats",
        "Data requirements",
        "Nodes"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "7c586f93fdc1eaff30c91e430394f51a121e7775",
        "sha256": "f0da5170934666563792a7b39628b17cd29c47bc87bd6f21ff69e7d6bdebf1a4",
        "lineStart": 100,
        "lineEnd": 100,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md#L100-L100"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.852d2db66efbdb28698f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, you can have the percentage of errors represented by a red portion of the circle. Additional details can be displayed in a context menu which is displayed when you click on the node. There also can be additional links in the context menu that can target either other parts of Grafana or any external link.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Node graph",
        "Supported data formats",
        "Data requirements",
        "Nodes"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "7c586f93fdc1eaff30c91e430394f51a121e7775",
        "sha256": "f0da5170934666563792a7b39628b17cd29c47bc87bd6f21ff69e7d6bdebf1a4",
        "lineStart": 102,
        "lineEnd": 104,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md#L102-L104"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d1489e03fa047506a67b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Edges can also show statistics when you hover over the edge. Similar to nodes, you can open a context menu with additional details and links by clicking on the edge.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Node graph",
        "Supported data formats",
        "Data requirements",
        "Edges"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "7c586f93fdc1eaff30c91e430394f51a121e7775",
        "sha256": "f0da5170934666563792a7b39628b17cd29c47bc87bd6f21ff69e7d6bdebf1a4",
        "lineStart": 110,
        "lineEnd": 110,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md#L110-L110"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
