      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Force** - Uses a physics-based force layout algorithm that's useful with a large number of nodes (500+).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Node graph",
        "Configuration options",
        "Node graph options",
        "Layout algorithm"
      ],
