    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.194864796d7b6c9cc94c",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Grid** - Arranges nodes into a grid format to provide a better overview of the most interesting nodes in the graph. This layout shows nodes in a grid without edges and can be sorted by the stats shown inside the node or by the ones represented by the a colored border of the nodes.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Node graph",
        "Configuration options",
        "Node graph options",
        "Layout algorithm"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/node-graph/index.md",
