      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| arc\\_\\_\\*     | number        | Any field prefixed with `arc__` will be used to create the color circle around the node. All values in these fields should add up to 1. You can specify color using `config.color.fixedColor`.                                                                                                                                                                           |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Node graph",
