      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The easiest way to provide data for a pie chart visualization is in a dataset with a single record (or row) containing the fields (or columns) that you want in the pie, as in the following example. The default settings of the pie chart visualization automatically display each column as a slice of the pie.",
