      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Show | Display a single value per column or series, or show values for each row. Choose from: <ul><li>**Calculate** - Display a calculated value based on all rows.</li><li>**All values** - Show a separate stat for every row. If you select this option, then you can also limit the number of rows to display.</li> |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Stat",
        "Configuration options",
        "Value options"
      ],
