      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Orientation | Select the stat tile layout. Choose from: <ul><li>**Auto** - Grafana selects the ideal orientation.</li><li>**Horizontal** - Stat tiles are arranged left to right.</li><li>**Vertical** - Stat tiles are arranged top to bottom.</li></ul> |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Stat",
        "Configuration options",
        "Stat styles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/stat/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "2ff3c9216047b66bcf67ff68de885ff49b13cc47",
        "sha256": "37e5c2dc3f29c7210f0dbacfc870810100459d040bb7392837ffa32108eed866",
