      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If your query results aren't in a table format like the preceding examples, especially for time-series data, you can apply specific [transformations](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/68887416/grafana-state-timeline-panel-with-values-states-supplied-by-label) to achieve this.",
