    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9182d4e9c10d4638ba08",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A status history visualization displays data in a way that shows periodic states over time. In a status history, each field or series is rendered as a horizontal row, with multiple boxes showing the different statuses. This provides you with a centralized view for the status of a component or service.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Status history"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/status-history/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3a84975929b77fafd272edff19036ee99b612013",
        "sha256": "833b303a4721b397fcef1f32733947fad370682378c5c073e35fc704b7f1ab31",
        "lineStart": 23,
        "lineEnd": 23,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/status-history/index.md#L23-L23"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1da9cfb908af8060687c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, if you're monitoring the health status of different services, you can use a status history to visualize the different statuses, such as “True” or \"False,\" over time. Each status is represented by a different color:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Status history"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/visualizations/panels-visualizations/visualizations/status-history/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3a84975929b77fafd272edff19036ee99b612013",
