    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ea4210bfab7a18c32b2a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Once you've [created a dashboard](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/dashboards/build-dashboards/create-dashboard/), you can use the following state timeline video as a reference for how to configure a status history:",
