      "id": "grafana.candidate.26fa9fbc62f668df055c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The table footer displays the results of calculations (and reducer functions) on fields. The footer is only displayed after you select an option in the **Calculation** drop-down list:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Table",
