      "id": "grafana.candidate.71fd2222d4e62c5e8a49",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The maximum and minimum values of the gauges are configured automatically from the smallest and largest values in your whole dataset. If you don't want the max/min values to be pulled from the whole dataset, you can configure them for each column using [field overrides](#field-overrides).",
