      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can color sparklines using thresholds by setting the field's color scheme to **From thresholds (by value)** in the [standard color scheme options](ref:color-scheme), using an override, and setting **Gradient mode** to **Scheme**. When thresholds are defined, the sparkline automatically reflects threshold levels along the line.",
