      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, the HTML rendered is sanitized, and un-sanitized HTML can only be rendered in these cells if the [`disable_sanitize_html`](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#disable_sanitize_html) option is set to true for your Grafana instance.",
