      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you toggle the switch on, you can select from a drop-down list any of the fields in the table to be used as the source of the tooltip content. All table fields are included in the drop-down list, whether visible or hidden.",
