    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.52239e6595bd19cdf502",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The content of the tooltip is determined by the values of the source field and can't be directly edited. However, you can affect the display of the value using overrides like value mappings, as shown in the [Example: Tooltip from field with value mappings](#example-tooltip-from-field-with-value-mappings) section.",
