      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Toggle on the **Styling from field** switch to apply the styling from another field (or column). The referenced field must contain [CSS properties](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CSSStyleProperties) formatted in JSON object syntax. For example:",
