    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.576190400cbfd5425200",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "While you can turn on this option under **Cell options** and have it applied to all cells in the table, it's typically used as an override on a sub-set of cells instead. This is demonstrated in the following example.",
