      "id": "grafana.candidate.4a701c45aca384550352",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you add the offset, the resulting visualization makes the datasets appear to be occurring at the same time so that you can compare them more easily.",
