      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can [link alert rules](ref:link-alert) to time series visualizations in the form of annotations to observe when alerts fire and are resolved. In addition, you can create alert rules from the **Alert** tab within the [panel editor](ref:panel-data-section).",
      "headingPath": [
