      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "While you can add a trace visualization to a dashboard, having to manually add trace IDs as a dashboard variable is cumbersome. It's more useful to instead be able to use TraceQL queries to search for specific types of traces and then select appropriate traces from matching results.",
