      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The results in the traces visualization include links to the **Explore** page that renders the trace. You can add other links to traces in the table that fill in the `traceId` dashboard variable when selected, so that the trace is visualized in the same dashboard.",
