      "sourceText": "| [Series mapping](#series-mapping) | Set how series data is mapped in the chart. Choose from: **Auto** and **Manual**. Depending on your series mapping selection, the **Frame**, **X-field**, and **Y-field** options differ. For information on setting these specific fields, refer to the [Series mapping section](#series-mapping). |",
