      "id": "grafana.candidate.d0c1ccf3355b88b9cd6d",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Size field | Set which field's values control the size of the points in the chart. This value is relative to the min and max of all the values in the data frame. When you select this option, you can then set the **Min point size** and **Max point size** options. Required in **Manual** mode. |",
      "headingPath": [
        "XY chart",
        "Configuration options",
        "XY Chart options"
      ],
      "source": {
