      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In **Auto** series mapping mode, after the x-field is set, by default, all the remaining number fields in the data frame are designated as the y-fields. You can use this option to explicitly choose which fields to use for y.",
