    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d3b443304aa984785e5f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can now configure SAML using our new user interface, making the process easier and more convenient than ever before. With the new user interface (UI), you can now configure SAML without needing to restart Grafana and you can control access to the configuration UI by using [role-based access control (RBAC)](../../administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/), which makes the process much faster and more efficient.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v10.0",
        "Authentication and authorization",
        "Configure your SAML provider in the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "744b2d1230211f70aa6158231d9505e732ac0315",
        "sha256": "dd311853975cca7ef6ad474588f832614dd9c445856343920d238a1ddf183739",
        "lineStart": 265,
        "lineEnd": 266,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-0.md#L265-L266"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a183e647a9899787b4b2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For more information on how to set up SAML using the Grafana UI, refer to [Configure SAML authentication using the Grafana user interface](../../setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml-ui/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v10.0",
        "Authentication and authorization",
        "Configure your SAML provider in the Grafana UI"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "744b2d1230211f70aa6158231d9505e732ac0315",
        "sha256": "dd311853975cca7ef6ad474588f832614dd9c445856343920d238a1ddf183739",
        "lineStart": 270,
        "lineEnd": 270,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-0.md#L270-L270"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.babe5886f4bd2fa1a885",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Usernames and email addresses are now treated as case-insensitive, which means that you no longer need to worry about capitalization when logging in or creating an account.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v10.0",
        "Authentication and authorization",
        "Case-insensitive usernames and email addresses"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "744b2d1230211f70aa6158231d9505e732ac0315",
        "sha256": "dd311853975cca7ef6ad474588f832614dd9c445856343920d238a1ddf183739",
        "lineStart": 278,
        "lineEnd": 278,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-0.md#L278-L278"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2bf409a2bb74ea5d7c1b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "From now on, whether you type your username or email address in uppercase, lowercase, or a combination of both, Grafana will treat them as the same. This simplifies the login process and reduces the risk of typos and identity conflicts when changing authentication providers.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v10.0",
        "Authentication and authorization",
        "Case-insensitive usernames and email addresses"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "744b2d1230211f70aa6158231d9505e732ac0315",
        "sha256": "dd311853975cca7ef6ad474588f832614dd9c445856343920d238a1ddf183739",
        "lineStart": 280,
        "lineEnd": 280,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-0.md#L280-L280"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.08d9b912d2983518c875",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you're running Grafana with MySQL as a database, this change doesn't have any impact as MySQL users were already treated as case-insensitive.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v10.0",
        "Authentication and authorization",
        "Case-insensitive usernames and email addresses"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "744b2d1230211f70aa6158231d9505e732ac0315",
        "sha256": "dd311853975cca7ef6ad474588f832614dd9c445856343920d238a1ddf183739",
        "lineStart": 286,
        "lineEnd": 286,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-0.md#L286-L286"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
