    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.198d5918623bb2deda0a",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Sandwich view**: You can now show a sandwich view of any symbol in the flame graph. Sandwich view shows all the callers on the top and all the callees of the symbol on the bottom. This is useful when you want to see the context of a symbol.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v10.1",
        "Dashboards and visualizations",
        "Flame graph improvements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-1.md",
