    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6d75c08975bef4b5d239",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Switching color scheme**: You can now switch color scheme between a color gradient based on the relative value of a symbol or by the package name of a symbol.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v10.1",
        "Dashboards and visualizations",
        "Flame graph improvements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-1.md",
