    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e565c90aded3b17d5127",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Previously, the only transformation that supported [dashboard variables](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/dashboards/variables/) was the **Add field from calculation** transformation. We've now extended the support for variables to the **Filter by value**, **Create heatmap**, **Histogram**, **Sort by**, **Limit**, **Filter by name**, and **Join by field** transformations.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v10.2",
        "Transformations",
        "Use dashboard variables in transformations"
      ],
      "source": {
