      "id": "grafana.candidate.890538e1b8b50baf491b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With the new **Format string** transformation, you can manipulate string fields to improve how they're displayed. The currently supported operations are:",
