    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f18ce0f387f88499c5ea",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "We're also adding some basic statistical analysis features as a way to help you visualize trends in your data. The **Regression analysis** transformation will fit a mathematical function to your data and display it as predicted data points in a separate data frame.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v10.3",
        "Dashboards and visualizations",
        "Moving average and trend lines using transformations",
        "Trend lines\\*"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-3.md",
