    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f681a3669f4a22c4889d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Use Alerting insights to monitor your alerting data, discover key trends about your organization’s alert management performance, and find patterns in why things go wrong.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v10.3",
        "Alerting",
        "Alerting insights\\*"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-3.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e43fdcd331e25519da2fbdea223ad59ec4f7ad4c",
        "sha256": "0e1c94c3c83b280306b5bf6a8543bb3a2707c17132691f3d48d3818f08b029c7",
        "lineStart": 253,
        "lineEnd": 253,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-3.md#L253-L253"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e3632543e506a851af4d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Export your alerting resources, such as alert rules, contact points, and notification policies as Terraform resources. A new “Modify export” mode for alert rules enables you to edit provisioned alert rules and export a modified version.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v10.3",
        "Alerting",
        "Export alerting resources to Terraform"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-3.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e43fdcd331e25519da2fbdea223ad59ec4f7ad4c",
        "sha256": "0e1c94c3c83b280306b5bf6a8543bb3a2707c17132691f3d48d3818f08b029c7",
        "lineStart": 261,
        "lineEnd": 261,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-3.md#L261-L261"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4169bce56316eeb49caf",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Contact points list view has been redesigned and split into two tabs: Contact Points and Notification Templates, making it easier to view all contact point information at a glance. You can now search for name and type of contact points and integrations, view how many notification policies each contact point is being used for, and navigate directly to the linked notification policies.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v10.3",
        "Alerting",
        "Contact points list view redesign"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-3.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e43fdcd331e25519da2fbdea223ad59ec4f7ad4c",
        "sha256": "0e1c94c3c83b280306b5bf6a8543bb3a2707c17132691f3d48d3818f08b029c7",
        "lineStart": 269,
        "lineEnd": 269,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-3.md#L269-L269"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3154b57153c50d2480cd",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Create alerts from dashboard panels. You can reuse the panel queries and create alerts based on them.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v10.3",
        "Alerting",
        "Create alerts from panels\\*"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-3.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e43fdcd331e25519da2fbdea223ad59ec4f7ad4c",
        "sha256": "0e1c94c3c83b280306b5bf6a8543bb3a2707c17132691f3d48d3818f08b029c7",
        "lineStart": 279,
        "lineEnd": 279,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-3.md#L279-L279"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b4398ff4b11f0692671c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Opsgenie contact point has been extended to allow users to optionally fill out responder information for their integration. Responders tell Opsgenie who an alert should notify according to their escalation policies and routing rules.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v10.3",
        "Alerting",
        "Support for adding responders to Opsgenie alerting contact point\\*"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-3.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e43fdcd331e25519da2fbdea223ad59ec4f7ad4c",
        "sha256": "0e1c94c3c83b280306b5bf6a8543bb3a2707c17132691f3d48d3818f08b029c7",
        "lineStart": 287,
        "lineEnd": 287,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-3.md#L287-L287"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a15c465018bc477d9c69",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To reduce the noise of flapping alerts, you can set a recovery threshold different to the alert threshold.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v10.3",
        "Alerting",
        "Recovery thresholds for alerts"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-3.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e43fdcd331e25519da2fbdea223ad59ec4f7ad4c",
        "sha256": "0e1c94c3c83b280306b5bf6a8543bb3a2707c17132691f3d48d3818f08b029c7",
        "lineStart": 295,
        "lineEnd": 295,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-3.md#L295-L295"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.05384fa95a781a1355ce",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Flapping alerts occur when a metric hovers around the alert threshold condition and may lead to frequent state changes, resulting in too many notifications being generated.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v10.3",
        "Alerting",
        "Recovery thresholds for alerts"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-3.md",
