      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can now visualize geojson styles such as polygons, point color/size, and line strings. To learn more, [refer to the documentation](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/panels-visualizations/visualizations/geomap/#geojson-layer).",
