    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.086d4268a9f34d5e42d9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can now create subtables out of your data using the new **Group to nested tables** transformation. To use this feature, enable the `groupToNestedTableTransformation` [feature toggle](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/feature-toggles/#preview-feature-toggles).",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v10.4",
        "Dashboards and visualizations",
        "Create subtables in table visualizations with Group to nested tables"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v10-4.md",
