      "id": "grafana.candidate.4073fbd9e9c86a67a1da",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Rewrite the matchers for the new copy. For example, if the original matcher was `grafanafolder=folder_with/in_title`, then the new route matcher will be `grafana_folder=folder_with/_in_title`",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v11.0",
        "Dashboards and visualizations",
        "Subfolders"
