      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you would like to see what logs are linked to a specific trace or service, you can use the [Trace to logs feature](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/#trace-to-logs), which provides an easy way to create a custom link and set an appropriate time range if necessary.",
