      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To learn more about the strong password policy in Grafana, refer to the [documentation](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/grafana/#strong-password-policy).",
