      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To use the new XY chart visualization, you must first enable the `autoMigrateXYChartPanel` [feature toggle](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/feature-toggles/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v11.1",
