    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3928a63784a3efbf5487",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Manage silences through Role-Based Access Control (RBAC). In addition to the Grafana open source functionality in **Rule-specific silences with permissions**, you can choose who can create, edit, and read silences using the following permissions:",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v11.1",
        "Alerting",
        "Rule-specific silences with RBAC"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v11-1.md",
