      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0563fc071a2614d7ed96",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Users with the **alert.silences:create permission**, scoped within a folder, are able to create silences for rules contained within that folder and its subfolders",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v11.1",
        "Alerting",
        "Rule-specific silences with RBAC"
      ],
