    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e51a8a46df860fb4c516",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The GeoMap panel can now be used with a keyboard! Focus the map area, move around with the arrows keys and zoom in and out using + and -.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v11.1",
        "Recent accessibility improvements",
        "GeoMap keyboard support"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v11-1.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "914523a7f78d131db0348f0b42b05c53d8e00499",
        "sha256": "1e4e918c2b86d971d299831800abebdb03ca2c14febfc7d86e97f691b765b0b0",
        "lineStart": 179,
        "lineEnd": 179,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v11-1.md#L179-L179"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d145ab4391c647fee4e1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "We have [panel shortcuts](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/dashboards/use-dashboards/#keyboard-shortcuts), which previously only worked on whichever panel you hovered over. It now also takes into account the keyboard focus.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v11.1",
        "Recent accessibility improvements",
        "Panel shortcut keyboard support"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v11-1.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "914523a7f78d131db0348f0b42b05c53d8e00499",
        "sha256": "1e4e918c2b86d971d299831800abebdb03ca2c14febfc7d86e97f691b765b0b0",
        "lineStart": 183,
        "lineEnd": 183,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v11-1.md#L183-L183"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.557ffae71ebb62e51c29",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Users who are affected by a lot of animations on a web site have the possibility to configure [reduced motion settings](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@media/prefers-reduced-motion). Grafana now supports this, either by making animations simpler or removing them altogether. We have [implemented a rule](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/tree/main/packages/grafana-eslint-rules#no-unreduced-motion), which prohibits unhandled transitions and animations, ensuring that we can continuously support reduced motion.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v11.1",
        "Recent accessibility improvements",
        "Reduced motion support"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v11-1.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "914523a7f78d131db0348f0b42b05c53d8e00499",
        "sha256": "1e4e918c2b86d971d299831800abebdb03ca2c14febfc7d86e97f691b765b0b0",
        "lineStart": 193,
        "lineEnd": 193,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v11-1.md#L193-L193"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3bf3cc08b39d0b9818fc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For even more detail about all the changes in this release, refer to the [changelog](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md). For the specific steps we recommend when you upgrade to v11.2, check out our [Upgrade Guide](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/upgrade-guide/upgrade-v11.2/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v11.2"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v11-2.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ceccf569bb3670f6d3ae8c4db9fa3befbb8ef80a",
        "sha256": "e3947d9db32859fc717703f21b781da2366f7e2bda8dcfaeb51f1812ec5a1342",
        "lineStart": 27,
        "lineEnd": 27,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v11-2.md#L27-L27"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.53b52aa26d7b52a68e2e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This intuitive UI offers real-time updates on your migration status, making your migration journey faster, more efficient, and less error-prone. Initially, the Cloud Migration Assistant supports dashboards, folders, and core data sources, with plans to include alerting, app plugins, and panel plugins in future updates.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v11.2",
        "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant is in public preview"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v11-2.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ceccf569bb3670f6d3ae8c4db9fa3befbb8ef80a",
        "sha256": "e3947d9db32859fc717703f21b781da2366f7e2bda8dcfaeb51f1812ec5a1342",
        "lineStart": 37,
        "lineEnd": 37,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v11-2.md#L37-L37"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "What’s new in Grafana v11.2 > Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant is in public preview"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9070f5bdc5f7d175295f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "As Grafana keeps growing, we have had feedback that it can be hard to find the pages you are looking for in the navigation. That is why we have added a new section to the navigation called 'Bookmarks', so you can easily access all of your favourite pages at the top of the navigation.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v11.2",
        "Navigation bookmarks"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v11-2.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ceccf569bb3670f6d3ae8c4db9fa3befbb8ef80a",
        "sha256": "e3947d9db32859fc717703f21b781da2366f7e2bda8dcfaeb51f1812ec5a1342",
        "lineStart": 49,
        "lineEnd": 49,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v11-2.md#L49-L49"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8a637d60d7d18db900b9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This feature is being rolled out across Grafana Cloud now. To use Bookmarks in self-managed Grafana, turn on the `pinNavItems` [feature toggle](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/feature-toggles/) in Grafana v11.2 or newer.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v11.2",
        "Navigation bookmarks"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v11-2.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ceccf569bb3670f6d3ae8c4db9fa3befbb8ef80a",
        "sha256": "e3947d9db32859fc717703f21b781da2366f7e2bda8dcfaeb51f1812ec5a1342",
        "lineStart": 51,
