    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fbd0d3111561f1a4710e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With **Explore Logs** you can visualize and explore your logs to troubleshoot without having to write queries. It is easy to find spikes in your log volume, filter your logs and pinpoint problematic log lines.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v11.3",
        "Explore Logs",
        "The Explore Logs plugin is installed by default"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v11-3.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "5eb55341a0458eac320b2317223af815e066d128",
        "sha256": "42f0fbcea86ed7f49f166bc9b279b95673f27c4ef505737f7b54ede18c391332",
        "lineStart": 168,
        "lineEnd": 168,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v11-3.md#L168-L168"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3c495503ce5b2258cfbf",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "While **Explore Logs** is [GA in cloud](https://grafana.com/blog/2024/09/24/queryless-metrics-logs-traces-profiles/#explore-logs) and installed there by default already, with Grafana v11.3.0 it will be automatically installed on your Open Source or Enterprise instance as well. This will let you use Explore Logs alongside **Explore Metrics** without needing to install it manually.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What’s new in Grafana v11.3",
        "Explore Logs",
        "The Explore Logs plugin is installed by default"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v11-3.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "5eb55341a0458eac320b2317223af815e066d128",
