      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For Grafana v12.0, we've also provided a list of [breaking changes](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v12-0/#breaking-changes) to help you upgrade with greater confidence. For our purposes, a breaking change is any change that requires users or operators to do something. This includes:",
