    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9f77828f080690c8f04a",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Outer join:** Joins many time series/tables by a field. This can be used to outer join multiple time series on the _time_ field to show many time series in one table.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.0",
        "Transformations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-0.md",
