    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6cf6acdb08774c40dcc5",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Add field from calculation:** This is a powerful transformation that allows you perform many different types of math operations and add the result as a new field. Can be used to calculate the difference between two series or fields and add the result to a new field. Or multiply one field with another and add the result to a new field.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.0",
        "Transformations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-0.md",
