    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d9b2dfecc5719069bb79",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To learn more, start with the [overview](https://grafana.com/developers/plugin-tools/key-concepts/backend-plugins/). Next, in this [tutorial](https://grafana.com/developers/plugin-tools/tutorials/build-a-data-source-backend-plugin) you'll learn how to build a backend for a data source plugin and enable it for use with [Grafana Alerting](../../alerting/). Make sure to keep an eye out for additional documentation and tutorials that will be published after the Grafana v7.0 release.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.0",
        "Plugins platform",
        "Support for backend plugins"
      ],
      "source": {
