      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.66f66d432c21e1d03afe",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Date formats are set for a Grafana instance by adjusting [server-wide settings](../../setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#date_formats) in the Grafana configuration file. We hope to add org- and user-level settings in the future.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.2",
        "New date formatting options added"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-2.md",
