    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fdefda4cb2558b3daa22",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "As you can see this adds new continuous color schemes where Grafana will interpolate colors. A great use of these new color schemes is the table panel where you can color the background and get a heatmap like effect.",
      "headingPath": [
