    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d045d1dc554041a79e9b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "_Server-side expressions_ is an experimental feature that allows you to manipulate data returned from backend data source queries. Expressions allow you to manipulate data with math and other operations when the data source is a backend data source or a **--Mixed--** data source.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.4",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Server-side expressions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-4.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "10f50eec0a661654510f63805294c24968acadad",
        "sha256": "edb4cc6f7fd075796d11237820052a62e2220cdfb904cbc4c113af5f6734066d",
        "lineStart": 107,
        "lineEnd": 107,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-4.md#L107-L107"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e9607274121f99a22650",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The main use case is for [multi-dimensional](../../fundamentals/timeseries-dimensions/) data sources used with the upcoming next generation alerting, but expressions can be used with backend data sources and visualization as well.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.4",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Server-side expressions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-4.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "10f50eec0a661654510f63805294c24968acadad",
        "sha256": "edb4cc6f7fd075796d11237820052a62e2220cdfb904cbc4c113af5f6734066d",
        "lineStart": 109,
        "lineEnd": 109,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-4.md#L109-L109"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f31d1a5a396219eaea9a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For more information, refer to [Write expression queries](../../panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/expression-queries/). [About queries](../../panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/#about-queries) was also updated as a result of this feature.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.4",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Server-side expressions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-4.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "10f50eec0a661654510f63805294c24968acadad",
        "sha256": "edb4cc6f7fd075796d11237820052a62e2220cdfb904cbc4c113af5f6734066d",
        "lineStart": 113,
        "lineEnd": 113,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-4.md#L113-L113"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.80eb849fa8e13b0f5624",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can now provide detailed information to alert notification recipients by injecting alert label data as template variables into an alert notification. Labels that exist from the evaluation of the alert query can be used in the alert rule name and in the alert notification message fields using the `${Label}` syntax. The alert label data is automatically injected into the notification fields when the alert is in the alerting state. When there are multiple unique values for the same label, the values are comma-separated.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.4",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Alert notification query label interpolation"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-4.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "10f50eec0a661654510f63805294c24968acadad",
        "sha256": "edb4cc6f7fd075796d11237820052a62e2220cdfb904cbc4c113af5f6734066d",
        "lineStart": 117,
        "lineEnd": 117,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-4.md#L117-L117"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.71784e8e14571b396d91",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "We have added support for [Content Security Policy (CSP)](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/CSP), a layer of security that helps detect and mitigate certain types of attacks, including Cross Site Scripting (XSS) and data injection attacks.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.4",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Content security policy support"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-4.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "10f50eec0a661654510f63805294c24968acadad",
        "sha256": "edb4cc6f7fd075796d11237820052a62e2220cdfb904cbc4c113af5f6734066d",
        "lineStart": 123,
        "lineEnd": 123,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-4.md#L123-L123"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d62ee4d6768f86f77050",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "CSP support is disabled by default, to enable it you must set `content_security_policy = true` in the Grafana configuration. If enabling it, you should also review, and potentially tweak, the CSP header template, via the configuration setting `content_security_policy_template`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.4",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Content security policy support"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-4.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "10f50eec0a661654510f63805294c24968acadad",
        "sha256": "edb4cc6f7fd075796d11237820052a62e2220cdfb904cbc4c113af5f6734066d",
        "lineStart": 125,
        "lineEnd": 125,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-4.md#L125-L125"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.541dd05419cf3f77902a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can lock down what can be done in the frontend code. Lock down what can be loaded, what JavaScript is executed. Not compatible with some plugins.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.4",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Content security policy support"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-4.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "10f50eec0a661654510f63805294c24968acadad",
        "sha256": "edb4cc6f7fd075796d11237820052a62e2220cdfb904cbc4c113af5f6734066d",
        "lineStart": 127,
        "lineEnd": 127,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-4.md#L127-L127"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c1905b9936e552a464b7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "[content_security_policy](../../setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#content_security_policy) and [content_security_policy_template](../../setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#content_security_policy_template) were added to [Configuration](../../setup-grafana/configure-grafana/) as a result of this change.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.4",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Content security policy support"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-4.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "10f50eec0a661654510f63805294c24968acadad",
