    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fed7fc9b501c2b45ea8b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For new Prometheus data sources, we have changed the default HTTP method to POST. POST allows for much larger query bodies than using the GET method. This is necessary when sending queries from graphs with a lot of targets, for example, many hosts in a dashboard variable. The POST method also makes the Query Inspector data easier to read since the query is in plain text whereas the GET query is URL encoded.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.5",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Changed default HTTP method for new Prometheus data sources"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "1f762193f381b785ad3976e03c8d01c40a0022d5",
        "sha256": "16b32d97207c71fd11291c626f8e3a3697a2a6efe831270739f398e87132cc21",
        "lineStart": 54,
        "lineEnd": 54,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md#L54-L54"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a54804486b4c759f3f98",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When searching for text in Elasticsearch logs, matching words in the log line returned by the query are now highlighted.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.5",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Word highlighting for Elasticsearch"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "1f762193f381b785ad3976e03c8d01c40a0022d5",
        "sha256": "16b32d97207c71fd11291c626f8e3a3697a2a6efe831270739f398e87132cc21",
        "lineStart": 62,
        "lineEnd": 62,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md#L62-L62"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.71b4a38706dff6dbdefb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Previously, when users wanted to configure the Postgres data source to connect with SSL certification, they needed to put the certification on the server, and configure the data source with file path.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.5",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Paste in SSL certs for Postgres data source"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "1f762193f381b785ad3976e03c8d01c40a0022d5",
        "sha256": "16b32d97207c71fd11291c626f8e3a3697a2a6efe831270739f398e87132cc21",
        "lineStart": 74,
        "lineEnd": 74,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md#L74-L74"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.10649b6bc9183c3920e4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Instead of the file path, users can now paste the SSL certification content in the UI. This allows them to configure the certification even when they do not have access to the server.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.5",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Paste in SSL certs for Postgres data source"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "1f762193f381b785ad3976e03c8d01c40a0022d5",
        "sha256": "16b32d97207c71fd11291c626f8e3a3697a2a6efe831270739f398e87132cc21",
        "lineStart": 76,
        "lineEnd": 76,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md#L76-L76"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
