    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.38bcb42df6e41dae5b59",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If a Grafana instance has exceeded its licensed number of active users, then non-active users who try to sign in to Grafana will be prevented from doing so. Active users are users who have logged in to Grafana in the past 30 days. The total number of users registered in Grafana does not affect this rule. This enforcement is applied separately for Viewers and for Editor/Admins, so if you reach your active Viewer limit, new Editor/Admins will still be able to sign in. This rule also includes a 10% buffer, meaning that you need to exceed your limit by 10% before users are prevented from signing in.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.5",
        "Enterprise features",
        "Active user limits"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "1f762193f381b785ad3976e03c8d01c40a0022d5",
        "sha256": "16b32d97207c71fd11291c626f8e3a3697a2a6efe831270739f398e87132cc21",
        "lineStart": 142,
        "lineEnd": 142,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md#L142-L142"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8a2b2d94969a67e977f4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A Grafana Enterprise instance includes 100 Viewers and 50 Editor/Admins. Over the course of the last 30 days, 110 Viewers and 20 Editor/Admins have signed in to Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.5",
        "Enterprise features",
        "Active user limits"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "1f762193f381b785ad3976e03c8d01c40a0022d5",
        "sha256": "16b32d97207c71fd11291c626f8e3a3697a2a6efe831270739f398e87132cc21",
        "lineStart": 146,
        "lineEnd": 146,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md#L146-L146"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8b10d40fc6b9629623ac",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When a previously-inactive Viewer (someone who has not signed in over the past 30 days) tries to sign in, they will see a message and be prevented from signing in until the number of active users dips back below 110. New Editor/Admins are not affected by this; they can continue to sign in until the number of active Editors/Admins reaches 55.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.5",
        "Enterprise features",
        "Active user limits"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "1f762193f381b785ad3976e03c8d01c40a0022d5",
        "sha256": "16b32d97207c71fd11291c626f8e3a3697a2a6efe831270739f398e87132cc21",
        "lineStart": 150,
        "lineEnd": 150,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md#L150-L150"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.389a48bff7e9343ef1b5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you try to sign in to a fourth device or browser, then you will be prevented from doing so; the limit of concurrent sessions is three.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.5",
        "Enterprise features",
        "Active user limits"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "1f762193f381b785ad3976e03c8d01c40a0022d5",
        "sha256": "16b32d97207c71fd11291c626f8e3a3697a2a6efe831270739f398e87132cc21",
        "lineStart": 152,
        "lineEnd": 152,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md#L152-L152"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e8ca7ec7136eaa411cd9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you sign in to a fourth device or browser, then you will be signed out of the session that is least current. Concurrent session limits Each Grafana Enterprise user will be limited to three concurrent user sessions. When a user opens a fourth session, then the longest-inactive session will be automatically signed out.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.5",
        "Enterprise features",
        "Active user limits"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "1f762193f381b785ad3976e03c8d01c40a0022d5",
        "sha256": "16b32d97207c71fd11291c626f8e3a3697a2a6efe831270739f398e87132cc21",
        "lineStart": 154,
        "lineEnd": 156,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md#L154-L156"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1ec6105af2f92e406790",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A new session is created when you sign in to Grafana from a different device or a different browser. Multiple windows and tabs in the same browser are all part of the same session, so having many Grafana tabs open will not cause any issues.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v7.5",
        "Enterprise features",
        "Active user limits"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "1f762193f381b785ad3976e03c8d01c40a0022d5",
        "sha256": "16b32d97207c71fd11291c626f8e3a3697a2a6efe831270739f398e87132cc21",
        "lineStart": 158,
        "lineEnd": 158,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v7-5.md#L158-L158"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4a97faed1d70d7e13466",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This topic includes the release notes for Grafana v8.0. For all details, read the full [CHANGELOG.md](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md).",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.0"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "08364874bf79c35cb3f0d907a16891c4cfb0eb1c",
        "sha256": "6f07cb510f8b0da003b838c600c8c34236d365c4cc7688913f7fe726f50a0fd7",
        "lineStart": 24,
        "lineEnd": 24,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md#L24-L24"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.54c2fdfeb08cc915f1ff",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The new alerts in Grafana 8.0 are an opt-in feature that centralizes alerting information for Grafana managed alerts and alerts from Prometheus-compatible data sources in one UI and API. You can create and edit alerting rules for Grafana managed alerts, Mimir alerts, and Loki alerts as well as see alerting information from prometheus-compatible data sources in a single, searchable view. For more information, on how to create and edit alerts and notifications, refer to [Grafana Alerting](../../alerting/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.0",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Grafana v8.0 alerts"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "08364874bf79c35cb3f0d907a16891c4cfb0eb1c",
        "sha256": "6f07cb510f8b0da003b838c600c8c34236d365c4cc7688913f7fe726f50a0fd7",
        "lineStart": 32,
        "lineEnd": 32,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md#L32-L32"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8ad88fdc7dcf786eaea1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "As part of the new alert changes, we have introduced a new data source, Alertmanager, which includes built-in support for Prometheus Alertmanager. It is presently in alpha and it not accessible unless alpha plugins are enabled in Grafana settings. For more information, refer to [Alertmanager data source](../../datasources/alertmanager/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.0",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Grafana v8.0 alerts"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "08364874bf79c35cb3f0d907a16891c4cfb0eb1c",
        "sha256": "6f07cb510f8b0da003b838c600c8c34236d365c4cc7688913f7fe726f50a0fd7",
        "lineStart": 34,
        "lineEnd": 34,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md#L34-L34"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c9b1a41d6cb442ab7a36",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "> **Note:** Out of the box, Grafana still supports old Grafana alerts. They are legacy alerts at this time, and will be deprecated in a future release.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.0",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Grafana v8.0 alerts"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "08364874bf79c35cb3f0d907a16891c4cfb0eb1c",
        "sha256": "6f07cb510f8b0da003b838c600c8c34236d365c4cc7688913f7fe726f50a0fd7",
        "lineStart": 36,
