        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md#L36-L36"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.84a42e05fc0d24e91c10",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Library panels allow users to build panels that can be used in multiple dashboards. Any updates made to that shared panel will then automatically be applied to all the dashboards that have that panel. For instructions on how to create, add, unlink and manage library panels, refer to [Library panels](../../dashboards/build-dashboards/manage-library-panels/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.0",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Library panels"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "08364874bf79c35cb3f0d907a16891c4cfb0eb1c",
        "sha256": "6f07cb510f8b0da003b838c600c8c34236d365c4cc7688913f7fe726f50a0fd7",
        "lineStart": 42,
        "lineEnd": 42,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md#L42-L42"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.71f97e698c7a518ffadf",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Data sources can now send real-time updates to dashboards over a websocket connection. This can be used with the [MQTT data source](https://github.com/grafana/mqtt-datasource).",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.0",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Real-time streaming"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md",
