    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.412fe8b19d4b8e87e4ea",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Bar chart panel is a new visualization that supports categorical data. It only supports one data frame and it needs to have at least one string field that will be used as the category for an X or Y axis and one or more numerical fields.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.0",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Bar chart visualization (beta)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "08364874bf79c35cb3f0d907a16891c4cfb0eb1c",
        "sha256": "6f07cb510f8b0da003b838c600c8c34236d365c4cc7688913f7fe726f50a0fd7",
        "lineStart": 60,
        "lineEnd": 60,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md#L60-L60"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.35d9cf1d9e7cb32187e6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To use it with time series you first have to add a **Reduce** transform.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.0",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Bar chart visualization (beta)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "08364874bf79c35cb3f0d907a16891c4cfb0eb1c",
        "sha256": "6f07cb510f8b0da003b838c600c8c34236d365c4cc7688913f7fe726f50a0fd7",
        "lineStart": 64,
        "lineEnd": 64,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md#L64-L64"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4d80d97aef35af832d1e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The State timeline visualization shows discrete state changes over time. Each field or series is rendered as a unique horizontal band. This panel works well with string or boolean states, but it can also be used with time series data. When used with time series data, the thresholds are used to turn the numerical values into discrete state regions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.0",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "State timeline visualization (beta)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "08364874bf79c35cb3f0d907a16891c4cfb0eb1c",
        "sha256": "6f07cb510f8b0da003b838c600c8c34236d365c4cc7688913f7fe726f50a0fd7",
        "lineStart": 70,
        "lineEnd": 70,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md#L70-L70"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.864e633fadfcf5904242",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This panel also takes advantage of the new value mapping features that allow you to color string and boolean values.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.0",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "State timeline visualization (beta)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "08364874bf79c35cb3f0d907a16891c4cfb0eb1c",
        "sha256": "6f07cb510f8b0da003b838c600c8c34236d365c4cc7688913f7fe726f50a0fd7",
        "lineStart": 72,
        "lineEnd": 72,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md#L72-L72"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.59770ad7008b9150df8f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A sister panel to the state timeline is the new Status history panel visualization. It can display periodic states in a grid view. It supports both numerical, string, or boolean states. You can assign colors using value mappings, thresholds, or gradient color. For more information, refer to [Status history](../../panels-visualizations/visualizations/status-history/). schemes.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.0",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Status history visualization (beta)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "08364874bf79c35cb3f0d907a16891c4cfb0eb1c",
        "sha256": "6f07cb510f8b0da003b838c600c8c34236d365c4cc7688913f7fe726f50a0fd7",
        "lineStart": 84,
        "lineEnd": 85,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md#L84-L85"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d952e9e43286059a1e26",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This hidden feature of the old Graph panel is now a standalone visualization. It combines a histogram transformation and bar chart visualization into a single, integrated, easy-to-use panel. There is also a new standalone histogram transformation that can be paired with any visualization.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.0",
        "Grafana OSS features",
        "Histogram visualization (beta)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-0.md",
