    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2aa14569096cc3367974",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Additional inline help will be available for Transformations. We can now share examples of how to use specific transformations and point users directly to the appropriate place in the docs for more information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.1",
        "Annotation panel",
        "Transformations improvements",
        "Contextual & Inline Help"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-1.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b54bfdf7dcc18fbe35f88f7d391c8c6f4b8f41b1",
        "sha256": "9a7f2035783113d2da54d193273dee3aed3102a8c825f1e34487836cb2423b66",
        "lineStart": 93,
        "lineEnd": 93,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-1.md#L93-L93"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6ada9d33802652eef57b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "We have added timezone support. As a result, you can now specify the time zone used in the database session, such as `Europe/Berlin` or `+02:00`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.1",
        "Annotation panel",
        "Data source updates",
        "MySQL Data Source"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-1.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b54bfdf7dcc18fbe35f88f7d391c8c6f4b8f41b1",
        "sha256": "9a7f2035783113d2da54d193273dee3aed3102a8c825f1e34487836cb2423b66",
        "lineStart": 101,
        "lineEnd": 101,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-1.md#L101-L101"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8aec98a4716a70b803ce",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "We changed the default behavior from creating a 1-hour span Loki query to the only query at the exact time the trace span started for the duration of it. For more fine grained control over this, you can shift this time in the tracing data source settings. Also, it is now possible to shift the start time and end time of the Loki query by the set amount. For more information, refer to [Trace to logs](../../datasources/tempo/#trace-to-logs).",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.1",
        "Annotation panel",
        "Trace to logs improvements"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-1.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b54bfdf7dcc18fbe35f88f7d391c8c6f4b8f41b1",
        "sha256": "9a7f2035783113d2da54d193273dee3aed3102a8c825f1e34487836cb2423b66",
        "lineStart": 105,
        "lineEnd": 105,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-1.md#L105-L105"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d032602510339d81fa40",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For more on how to prettify JSON logs, refer to [Visualization](../../panels-visualizations/visualizations/) and [Display](../../panels-visualizations/visualizations/logs/) options.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.1",
        "Annotation panel",
        "Prettify JSON for Logs in Explore"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-1.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b54bfdf7dcc18fbe35f88f7d391c8c6f4b8f41b1",
        "sha256": "9a7f2035783113d2da54d193273dee3aed3102a8c825f1e34487836cb2423b66",
        "lineStart": 117,
        "lineEnd": 117,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-1.md#L117-L117"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9a658b44280782f2d30b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "We’ve made some changes to the plugins UI to help make it easier to discover and manage your plugins. Enterprise users can now also manage enterprise plugins from within the catalog.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.1",
        "Annotation panel",
        "Plugin catalog - Updated UX and extended features"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-1.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b54bfdf7dcc18fbe35f88f7d391c8c6f4b8f41b1",
        "sha256": "9a7f2035783113d2da54d193273dee3aed3102a8c825f1e34487836cb2423b66",
        "lineStart": 121,
        "lineEnd": 121,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-1.md#L121-L121"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.88f96effdfdf5e23225b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `@grafana/ui` exposes a `Select` component, and its variants `MultiSelect`, `AsyncSelect`, and `AsyncMultiSelect`. We have made some internal changes to these components to make the behavior and positioning more consistent in all scenarios.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.1",
        "Annotation panel",
        "Upcoming changes to the Select component"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-1.md",
