    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9668d2cbbae77a0b8019",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The grafana server serves a [SwaggerUI](https://swagger.io/tools/swagger-ui/) editor via the /swagger-ui endpoint that enables users to make requests to the HTTP API via the browser. This is disabled by default and it’s enabled when the `swaggerUi` feature toggle is set.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.4",
        "OSS",
        "OpenAPI v2 specification"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-4.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "252f5beb8e3fcec627862bf9d7133a82ac790f48",
        "sha256": "698f50f998678faa1ffd85c3becf29427f209d103b67f78883e8ff9c47004eec",
        "lineStart": 113,
        "lineEnd": 113,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-4.md#L113-L113"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.90d23f7e772001a137b3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Occasionally, Viewer, Editor, and Admin roles don’t fit what a certain user needs to do in Grafana. Now you can assign role-based roles directly to users so they can create reports, use Explore mode, create data sources, and perform other specific actions in Grafana. Role-based access control is currently in beta.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.4",
        "Grafana Enterprise",
        "Security improvements",
        "Role-based access control works for teams"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-4.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "252f5beb8e3fcec627862bf9d7133a82ac790f48",
        "sha256": "698f50f998678faa1ffd85c3becf29427f209d103b67f78883e8ff9c47004eec",
        "lineStart": 121,
        "lineEnd": 121,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-4.md#L121-L121"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "What's new in Grafana v8.4 > Grafana Enterprise > Security improvements > Role-based access control works for teams"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.10cc14ced37a026e3a1d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In Grafana 8.4, you can assign roles to teams, which apply to all members of that team. This is a convenient way to grant certain permissions to a group of users all at once. It also makes permissions easier to manage when you synchronize groups from an SSO provider, like Google Oauth or Okta, to teams in Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.4",
        "Grafana Enterprise",
        "Security improvements",
        "Role-based access control works for teams"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-4.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "252f5beb8e3fcec627862bf9d7133a82ac790f48",
        "sha256": "698f50f998678faa1ffd85c3becf29427f209d103b67f78883e8ff9c47004eec",
        "lineStart": 123,
        "lineEnd": 123,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-4.md#L123-L123"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "What's new in Grafana v8.4 > Grafana Enterprise > Security improvements > Role-based access control works for teams"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.65e4e79048cc5bdadf73",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In 8.4 you can also control access to Team and API key functionality itself, like viewing or editing API keys and adding members to certain teams.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.4",
        "Grafana Enterprise",
        "Security improvements",
        "Role-based access control works for teams"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-4.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "252f5beb8e3fcec627862bf9d7133a82ac790f48",
        "sha256": "698f50f998678faa1ffd85c3becf29427f209d103b67f78883e8ff9c47004eec",
        "lineStart": 125,
        "lineEnd": 125,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-4.md#L125-L125"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "What's new in Grafana v8.4 > Grafana Enterprise > Security improvements > Role-based access control works for teams"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0abfb13589728973190d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Enable role-based access control by adding the term `accesscontrol` to the list of feature toggles in your [Grafana configuration](/docs/grafana/next/administration/configuration/#feature_toggles?mdm=email), or by sending a request to support if you use Grafana Cloud. Learn more about role-based access control in the [role-based access control section of the docs](/docs/grafana/next/enterprise/access-control/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.4",
        "Grafana Enterprise",
        "Security improvements",
        "Role-based access control works for teams"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-4.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "252f5beb8e3fcec627862bf9d7133a82ac790f48",
        "sha256": "698f50f998678faa1ffd85c3becf29427f209d103b67f78883e8ff9c47004eec",
        "lineStart": 127,
        "lineEnd": 127,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-4.md#L127-L127"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "What's new in Grafana v8.4 > Grafana Enterprise > Security improvements > Role-based access control works for teams"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9e3e27d78ac4f2f43645",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can use Grafana SAML integration to map organizations in your SAML service to [Organizations](../../setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/#configure-organization-mapping) in Grafana so that users who authenticate using SAML have the right permissions. Previously, you could only choose a single role (Viewer, Editor, or Admin) for users, which would apply to all of their Organizations. Now, you can map a given SAML user or org to different roles in different Organizations, so that, for example, they can be a Viewer in one Organization and an Admin in another.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.4",
        "Grafana Enterprise",
        "Security improvements",
        "Assign SAML users different roles in different Organizations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-4.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "252f5beb8e3fcec627862bf9d7133a82ac790f48",
        "sha256": "698f50f998678faa1ffd85c3becf29427f209d103b67f78883e8ff9c47004eec",
        "lineStart": 133,
        "lineEnd": 133,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-4.md#L133-L133"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "What's new in Grafana v8.4 > Grafana Enterprise > Security improvements > Assign SAML users different roles in different Organizations"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f02389cb2501e9dbdaf9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Additionally, you can now grant multiple SAML organizations access to Grafana, using the `allowed_organizations` attribute. Previously, you could only map one.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.4",
        "Grafana Enterprise",
        "Security improvements",
        "Assign SAML users different roles in different Organizations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-4.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "252f5beb8e3fcec627862bf9d7133a82ac790f48",
        "sha256": "698f50f998678faa1ffd85c3becf29427f209d103b67f78883e8ff9c47004eec",
        "lineStart": 135,
        "lineEnd": 135,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-4.md#L135-L135"
      },
      "applicability": {
