      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bd61df99b26b69007518",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "[Query caching](/blog/2021/09/02/reduce-costs-and-increase-performance-with-query-caching-in-grafana-cloud/) significantly reduces load times and costs of Grafana dashboards, by temporarily storing query results in a cache. Now you can measure the hit rate of your query cache, to see how many queries (and therefore how much time and money) it is saving. You can also use these measurements to tune the cache time to live (TTL), to balance performance and up-to-date data.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.4",
        "Grafana Enterprise",
        "Performance improvements",
        "Measure query cache hit rate and clear the cache"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-4.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "252f5beb8e3fcec627862bf9d7133a82ac790f48",
        "sha256": "698f50f998678faa1ffd85c3becf29427f209d103b67f78883e8ff9c47004eec",
        "lineStart": 149,
        "lineEnd": 149,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-4.md#L149-L149"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "What's new in Grafana v8.4 > Grafana Enterprise > Performance improvements > Measure query cache hit rate and clear the cache"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.29313df8dfbea39a28ed",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can also now manually clear the cache for a given data source in case data becomes stale, so that the next set of queries run against the data source itself.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.4",
        "Grafana Enterprise",
        "Performance improvements",
        "Measure query cache hit rate and clear the cache"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-4.md",
