    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.88ba66bc3f556561318a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "We’ve summarized what’s new in the release here, but you might also be interested in the announcement blog post as well. If you’d like all the details you can check out the complete [changelog](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md).",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.5"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "15f3fc25db59e3bac75e15217a2aedc351624e69",
        "sha256": "786bd58d8bd4959f301bf1e3d7b428b4f76f342335b19cd744f6500e818040c8",
        "lineStart": 26,
        "lineEnd": 26,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-5.md#L26-L26"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6306abdb3805bbd35eae",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "It’s been tricky to work with more than a small number of Grafana-managed alert rules without groups in namespaces. They’ve also been inconsistent with the [Prometheus Alert Generator Compliance Specification](https://github.com/prometheus/compliance/blob/main/alert_generator/specification.md), which made working with Grafana-managed and Prometheus-managed alerts a confusing experience. With this release, you can still see flattened Grafana-managed alerts in the “List” tab, or use the new “Grouped” tab to work with groups:",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.5",
        "OSS",
        "Alerting - group names for Grafana-managed alert rules"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "15f3fc25db59e3bac75e15217a2aedc351624e69",
        "sha256": "786bd58d8bd4959f301bf1e3d7b428b4f76f342335b19cd744f6500e818040c8",
        "lineStart": 32,
        "lineEnd": 32,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-5.md#L32-L32"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.20ac0c98b719e92fa4db",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Rules in a group are evaluated together, so you can also set the interval for the entire group.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.5",
        "OSS",
        "Alerting - group names for Grafana-managed alert rules"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "15f3fc25db59e3bac75e15217a2aedc351624e69",
        "sha256": "786bd58d8bd4959f301bf1e3d7b428b4f76f342335b19cd744f6500e818040c8",
        "lineStart": 38,
        "lineEnd": 38,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-5.md#L38-L38"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.30c9c8bc537bd915f83d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can now enable Grafana version update checking and Grafana plugins version update checking separately using [a new configuration option to separately enable plugin version update checks](/docs/grafana/latest/administration/configuration/#check_for_plugin_updates). The [prior version update checking configuration](/docs/grafana/latest/administration/configuration/#check_for_updates) now only controls Grafana version update checks.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.5",
        "OSS",
        "Analytics"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "15f3fc25db59e3bac75e15217a2aedc351624e69",
        "sha256": "786bd58d8bd4959f301bf1e3d7b428b4f76f342335b19cd744f6500e818040c8",
        "lineStart": 44,
        "lineEnd": 44,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-5.md#L44-L44"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f7910562f87019d4d418",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When enabled, a check runs every 10 minutes. It will notify, via the UI, when a new version is available. The checks will not prompt any auto-updates of the Grafana software, nor will it send any sensitive information.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.5",
        "OSS",
        "Analytics"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "15f3fc25db59e3bac75e15217a2aedc351624e69",
        "sha256": "786bd58d8bd4959f301bf1e3d7b428b4f76f342335b19cd744f6500e818040c8",
        "lineStart": 46,
        "lineEnd": 46,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-5.md#L46-L46"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f74c99adbad71865eb10",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In addition to RSS feeds, the News panel now supports Atom feeds, allowing you to display a wider range of data and information in Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.5",
        "OSS",
        "Dashboard Panels"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "15f3fc25db59e3bac75e15217a2aedc351624e69",
        "sha256": "786bd58d8bd4959f301bf1e3d7b428b4f76f342335b19cd744f6500e818040c8",
        "lineStart": 58,
        "lineEnd": 58,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-5.md#L58-L58"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fef08d88692d239fa470",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Bar gauge panel now supports scrolling to support displaying large datasets while maintaining the readability of labels. You can set a min width or height for the bars (depending on the chart’s orientation), allowing the content to overflow in the container and become scrollable.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.5",
        "OSS",
        "Dashboard Panels",
        "Scrolling in the Bar gauge panel"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "15f3fc25db59e3bac75e15217a2aedc351624e69",
        "sha256": "786bd58d8bd4959f301bf1e3d7b428b4f76f342335b19cd744f6500e818040c8",
        "lineStart": 62,
        "lineEnd": 62,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-5.md#L62-L62"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.56627bd90af8bf80d8a5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "We’ve added support to substitute template variables to transformations. This allows dashboards to be more interactive with transformations when a user inputs calculations and `$__interval` and `$__interval_ms`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v8.5",
        "OSS",
        "Transformations",
        "Template variable substitution"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "15f3fc25db59e3bac75e15217a2aedc351624e69",
        "sha256": "786bd58d8bd4959f301bf1e3d7b428b4f76f342335b19cd744f6500e818040c8",
        "lineStart": 72,
        "lineEnd": 72,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v8-5.md#L72-L72"
      },
      "applicability": {
