    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0f7f7eb68af187b9fb7c",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- We have changed the internals of `backendSrv.fetch()` to throw an error when the response is an incorrect JSON. Make sure to handle possible errors on the callsite where using `backendSrv.fetch()` (or any other `backendSrv` methods) [PR #47493](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/47493)",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v9.0",
        "Breaking changes",
        "Plugins: Most relevant breaking changes"
      ],
      "source": {
