    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d468a3c836a89603eace",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Prior to v9.3, if you wanted to plot a red trendline for US and a blue one for EU in the same TimeSeries panel, you would likely have to split this into two queries:",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v9.3",
        "New transformation: Partition by values"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v9-3.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "acf11473ed5777a12056a218dd89128f81813beb",
        "sha256": "64900ffbe97db576e8db0598932deb044076d62fbd415d6bfd717f2d4b707209",
        "lineStart": 107,
        "lineEnd": 107,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v9-3.md#L107-L107"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dfa5a4859085f4d70fcf",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This approach also requires you to know ahead of time which regions exist in the metrics table.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v9.3",
        "New transformation: Partition by values"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v9-3.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "acf11473ed5777a12056a218dd89128f81813beb",
        "sha256": "64900ffbe97db576e8db0598932deb044076d62fbd415d6bfd717f2d4b707209",
        "lineStart": 114,
        "lineEnd": 114,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v9-3.md#L114-L114"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b0ab799e6b2ebe040251",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "With the partition by values transformer, you can issue a single query and split the results by unique (enum) values from one or more columns (fields) of your choosing. In this case, Region.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v9.3",
        "New transformation: Partition by values"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v9-3.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "acf11473ed5777a12056a218dd89128f81813beb",
        "sha256": "64900ffbe97db576e8db0598932deb044076d62fbd415d6bfd717f2d4b707209",
        "lineStart": 116,
        "lineEnd": 116,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v9-3.md#L116-L116"
