      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "_Generally available on Grafana Cloud, and available to preview using the `topnav` [feature toggle](../../setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#feature_toggles) in all editions of Grafana._",
