    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3bc0461baddb72bb082c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "As Grafana evolved from a visualization platform to a comprehensive observability solution, we added numerous tools to support users throughout the software development life cycle. These tools focus on preventing incidents, monitoring applications or infrastructure, and aiding incident response. However, the added functionality must be easily discoverable and navigable to be truly helpful. These key updates to Grafana’s navigation experience help address this:",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v9.5",
        "Grafana's new navigation is generally available"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v9-5.md",
