    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5f1458718092aaa7573d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Also, a text **Add** dropdown with these options has replaced the previous \"+\" icon at the top of the dashboard. This makes it clearer that this element allows you not only to add new panels, but to take all the actions associated with building a new dashboard.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v9.5",
        "Dashboards and visualizations",
        "Redesigned empty dashboard state"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v9-5.md",
