      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9f7b7675d731fbdc5f6f",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Test your plugins against one of the latest [grafana-dev docker images](https://hub.docker.com/r/grafana/grafana-dev/tags?page=1) (for example, [this one](https://hub.docker.com/layers/grafana/grafana-dev/10.0.0-111404pre/images/sha256-ac78acf54b44bd2ce7e68b796b1df47030da7f35e53b02bc3eec3f4de05f780f?context=explore))",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v9.5",
        "Note for plugin developers"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/whatsnew/whats-new-in-v9-5.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c2c2ff159ae288e6085e71233ed9e2f0d46eabfc",
