      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8bfa420f9ebe05d3981e",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Add a comment to the [forum discussion](https://community.grafana.com/t/grafana-10-is-upgrading-to-react-18/86051) if your plugin is impacted in any way. Either to socialise the changes needed for your plugin or to reach out and ask for help yourself.",
      "headingPath": [
        "What's new in Grafana v9.5",
        "Note for plugin developers"
      ],
      "source": {
